/pages/home — Opens home.\\n\\n## Invariants\\n- Tax in one place — guard: none (docs/tax.md) — scope: billing/core/tax\\n\\n## Decisions\\n- 0001 Cobrança separada — docs/0001.md\\n\\n## Legacy statuses\\n- extracted: Foi para outro lugar."
`;

